## 1. Inference Architecture Flow



[PIPELINE title="End-to-End Inference Pipeline"]
User Query -> Semantic Tokenizer -> Mixture of Attention Layers -> Tool Calling Router -> Verifier Agent -> Streaming Output
[/PIPELINE]




